Getting Started with DevTools

This guide will help you install DevTools and create your first API test in minutes.

INstallation
DevTools is available in two formats: Studion Application and CLI Tool. You can download DevToolsStudio for  macOS, Windows
or Linux

Studio Application
Download the Studio app for your platform from the releases page:

Windows:
DevTools-{version}-win32-{arch}.exe

CLI Tool
The CLI is perfect for CI/CD pipelines and headless automation

With wget:

wget -q0- https://sh.dev.tools/install.sh | bash
